Make the amonet bootrom step run unattended (e.g. over SSH with no TTY):
the "remove the short and press Enter" prompt waits 4 s instead of reading stdin.
Apply inside the amonet folder:  patch -p1 < amonet-noninteractive.patch

--- a/modules/load_payload.py
+++ b/modules/load_payload.py
@@
     def run(self):
         print("")
         print(self.msg)
         print("")
-        input()
+        time.sleep(4)
         self.done = True
